            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/988aaab3699f980e6f7da3493fa66c2a.poster.avif?t=1786716630\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/988aaab3699f980e6f7da3493fa66c2a.webm?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/988aaab3699f980e6f7da3493fa66c2a.mp4?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the co-creator of Eufloria</strong> and <strong>Receiver 2</strong> comes a new indie extravaganza!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use supercharged <strong>photography</strong> to explore one of the deepest and most <strong>emergent ecosystems</strong> in games. Part Metroidvania, part <i>future science expedition</i>, Bioframe gives players the means to master a vast world in which <strong>all creatures react to each other in complex ways</strong>, with frequently unexpected results. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more the player understands their environment, the more they can <strong>find outrageous ways</strong> to make creatures part of gameplay solutions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.poster.avif?t=1786716630\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.webm?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.mp4?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break Out of the Box</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe’s eco system is so dynamic that players can <strong>create their own gameplay mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No torch for that dark, dangerous cave?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Photo-Stun</i></strong><i> a </i><strong><i>Laser Plant</i></strong><i> to steal its </i><strong><i>Glow Orb</i></strong><i>, stick it on a nervous </i><strong><i>Lizard</i></strong><i>, drive it ahead of you, and it will</i><strong><i> light the way</i></strong><i> while you follow at a safe distance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are countless ways players can create useful outcomes and develop new tactics. Snapping creatures doesn’t just <strong>stun</strong> them, it also unlocks all their <strong><i>behavioural quirks</i></strong> contained in their many AI states.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.poster.avif?t=1786716630\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.webm?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.mp4?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lateral Thinking Not Guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe avoids guns and any other cliched weapons.<strong> Everything in the world can be used,</strong> offensively or defensively, according to player preference and their knowledge of the world. <strong>Lateral thinking is key</strong> and easily rewarded. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are <strong>vampiric butterflies</strong> in the way? <strong>Lure</strong> them with their <strong>favourite food</strong> and <strong>add them to your inventory</strong> to create a <strong>portable attack swarm</strong>. Release them near enemies and <strong>they clear the way for you</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe offers unparalleled freedom to enterprising players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/d80938e09a1276b550a65900e538e90a.avif?t=1786716630\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive narrative-driven single player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast interactive open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the deepest ecosystems of its kind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge number of creatures with distinct AI states and behaviours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photography mechanic adds spice and meaning to exploration gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing ambient OST by the musician behind Eufloria</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the co-creator of Eufloria</strong> and <strong>Receiver 2</strong> comes a new indie extravaganza!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use supercharged <strong>photography</strong> to explore one of the deepest and most <strong>emergent ecosystems</strong> in games. Part Metroidvania, part <i>future science expedition</i>, Bioframe gives players the means to master a vast world in which <strong>all creatures react to each other in complex ways</strong>, with frequently unexpected results. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more the player understands their environment, the more they can <strong>find outrageous ways</strong> to make creatures part of gameplay solutions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.poster.avif?t=1786716630\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.webm?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.mp4?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break Out of the Box</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe’s eco system is so dynamic that players can <strong>create their own gameplay mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No torch for that dark, dangerous cave?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Photo-Stun</i></strong><i> a </i><strong><i>Laser Plant</i></strong><i> to steal its </i><strong><i>Glow Orb</i></strong><i>, stick it on a nervous </i><strong><i>Lizard</i></strong><i>, drive it ahead of you, and it will</i><strong><i> light the way</i></strong><i> while you follow at a safe distance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are countless ways players can create useful outcomes and develop new tactics. Snapping creatures doesn’t just <strong>stun</strong> them, it also unlocks all their <strong><i>behavioural quirks</i></strong> contained in their many AI states.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.poster.avif?t=1786716630\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.webm?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.mp4?t=1786716630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lateral Thinking Not Guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe avoids guns and any other cliched weapons.<strong> Everything in the world can be used,</strong> offensively or defensively, according to player preference and their knowledge of the world. <strong>Lateral thinking is key</strong> and easily rewarded. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are <strong>vampiric butterflies</strong> in the way? <strong>Lure</strong> them with their <strong>favourite food</strong> and <strong>add them to your inventory</strong> to create a <strong>portable attack swarm</strong>. Release them near enemies and <strong>they clear the way for you</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe offers unparalleled freedom to enterprising players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/d80938e09a1276b550a65900e538e90a.avif?t=1786716630\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive narrative-driven single player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast interactive open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the deepest ecosystems of its kind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge number of creatures with distinct AI states and behaviours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photography mechanic adds spice and meaning to exploration gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing ambient OST by the musician behind Eufloria</p></li></ul>",
